      {
        "step": 2,
        "title": "(1) 混合偏导相等",
        "content": "由 \\(f'''(u)\\) 连续知 \\(F_{xy}=F_{yx}\\)。令 \\(u=xy\\)：<br>\\(F_{xy}=\\dfrac{xyf'(xy)-f(xy)}{x^2y^2}=\\dfrac{u f'(u)-f(u)}{u^2}\\)，<br>\\(F_{yx}=\\dfrac{xyf'''(xy)-f''(xy)}{x^2y^2}=\\dfrac{u f'''(u)-f''(u)}{u^2}\\)。"
      },
