        "content": "\\(P=\\mathrm{e}^{x^2}\\sin x-2xy,\\ Q=6x-x^2-y\\cos^4y\\)。<br>\\(\\dfrac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}-\\dfrac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}=(6-2x)-(-2x)=6\\)。"
